"""
PyStation Lines v2.6 - Snap + Cell
==================================
A touch-first CAD sketcher for UTM parcel visits (Android primary).

Focus of v2.6:
- stronger smart snap, especially for line drawing
- line/chain workflow polish
- reusable CELL library for repeated items like legends

Features:
- CAD tools: Line, Polyline, Boundary (parcel), Length/Angle, Circle (CR/2P),
  Arc 3P, Rectangle, Polygon, Measure, Move/Copy/Rotate/Delete
- BoundaryItem (closed parcel or open polyline) with automatic survey labels:
  * P1..Pn vertex labels
  * edge lengths rotated parallel to each edge
  * parcel area at polygon centroid
- UTM coordinate table popup
- UTM <-> Geographic conversion
- Undo/Redo, zoom/pan, ortho, color palette
- CELL library:
  * save current drawing as a reusable cell
  * insert saved cell into current drawing

Quality upgrades in v2.6:
- smarter snap ranking: endpoint / vertex / intersection / midpoint / center / nearest
- sticky snap behavior so snap feels less shaky
- stronger line tool status flow
- grouped cell insert as one undo step
"""

